ness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 01-06-2016, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T15:45:59-08:00","id":802396,"title":"","content":"pg 155: Reference to <b>The God-machine Chronicle</b> should probably be <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T17:00:59-08:00","id":802457,"title":"","content":"Page 114 &quot;Some of these dead-zones are created by demons as they <b>devote</b> gradually clear an area of hostile Infrastructure.&quot; Devote doesn't make sense here. Delete it and get<br /> <br /> &quot;Some of these dead-zones are created by demons as they gradually clear an area of hostile Infrastructure.&quot; Which I suspect was the intended sentence.<br /> <br /> Page 126 &quot;Not all their stories can be true.&quot; <i>Possible</i> error, the sentence works as is. But it becomes more more clear if it's changed to<br /> &quot;Not all <b>of</b> their stories can be true.&quot; or even<br /> &quot;Not all stories can be true.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 01-06-2016, 08:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T19:27:45-08:00","id":802584,"title":"","content":"p. 18, How to Use This Book: &quot;<b>Chapter Three: The Company</b>&quot; \u2013 the title of chapter three is actually The View From the Inside","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T21:53:45-08:00","id":802678,"title":"","content":"P. 115 &quot;Influenced&quot; does not have a condition header and box like &quot;Infected&quot; and &quot;Enslaved&quot; do.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">P. 133 If the Disquiet was suffered by a Cover, switching to another Cover does not <b>resolves</b> this Condition as the affected Cover regains it when the demon switches back. - Should be &quot;does not resolve this Condition&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 01-07-2016, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T00:52:47-08:00","id":802917,"title":"","content":"p.60-1: &quot;She chooses Discorporate and Gauntlet Breach.&quot; &quot;Manifestation: Twilight Form, Discorporate, Gauntlet Breach.&quot; Given that the Super has a Cover (and is not a spirit), Gauntlet Breach should probably be replaced with <b>Materialize</b>.<br /> <br /> p.62: Descriptive text of The Burned Lot should be italicized, judging from the other Sample Missions.<br /> <br /> p.62: &quot;Now is the time that blood will rise to prominence, <b>ushering in new era where and cause thousands of Projects to come into fruition</b> in one glorious moment of supremacy.&quot; Superfluous &quot;where&quot; or &quot;and cause,&quot; or other error in sentence construction.<br /> <br /> p.64/72-3: &quot;How does the Destroyer <b>Madam X</b> differ from other Destroyers?&quot; Exile's character sheet refers to her as <b>Madame X</b>; given these are pronounced differently, a single spelling should probably be decided upon.<br /> <br /> p.66: &quot;Abandoned Eyes are cautious around angels \u2014 if their cache contains something of use to the angels there is little the <b>sliver</b> can do to protect it.&quot; Described behavior is not specific to slivers and analogous subsections of other Incarnations make no reference to slivers; possibly replace with <b>exile</b>.<br /> <br /> p.66: &quot;Murder is <b>the most common, but most</b> embrace more inventive habits.&quot; Repetitive. Suggest dropping &quot;<b>the most</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> p.68: &quot;Their bodies are made of molten metal, or <b>are have</b> armored hides, or bear multiple heads.&quot; Delete <b>are</b>.<br /> <br /> p.68: &quot;Once scorned, the abandoned <b>Swords</b> are slow to accept apologies.&quot; As this is in the Guardian section, this should be <b>Shields</b>.<br /> <br /> p.69: &quot;Sometimes Messenger-Angels alter their missives <b>every-so-slightly</b>.&quot; Should be <b>ever-so-slightly</b>. Does &quot;angel&quot; need to be capitalized?<br /> <br /> p.72: &quot;The exile has only <b>a moment take or reject opportunity</b>.&quot; Should probably be &quot;<b>a moment to take or reject the opportunity.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> p.72: &quot;Exiles are diverse; they are angels who are <b>not-quite</b> demons yet lack the strings of a loyal <b>member of the God-Machine\u2019s agents</b>.&quot; Superfluous hyphen; wordy phrase that could be replaced with &quot;<b>agent of the God-Machine</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> p.73-4: As Madam/e X and Samson have Covers, they should probably also have <b>Mortal Mask</b> on their lists of Numina; their Rank allows for it.<br /> <br /> p.74-5: Samson and Lik-a-lack's lists of Manifestations include <b>Manifestation</b>; this should be <b>Materialize</b>.<br /> <br /> p.75: &quot;The Psychopomp responsible<b> for matrix</b> miscalculated and <b>attempt</b> the ritual with just thirty-two.&quot; Should be &quot;<b>for the matrix</b>&quot; and &quot;<b>attempted</b>,&quot; respectively.<br /> <br /> p.78: The description for Echoes repeatedly uses the word <b>Numen</b> as a plural; Numen is the singular form of the more appropriate <b>Numina</b>.<br /> <br /> p.78: The other published ghosts indicate Kelly Casselman should probably have Influences more nuanced than &quot;Anchors 4&quot; if this is not specifically a divergence from normal ghost rules; Betrayal seems a suitable singular replacement.<br /> <br /> p.84: Some of the Incepts have no listed Essence cost for their primary effects. If &quot;Incepts have an Essence cost to activate their primary effect&quot; is intended to imply a minimum cost of 1, this should probably be made explicit; otherwise, the statement should probably be qualified.<br /> <br /> p.84: The Delivery Incept has multiple instances of &quot;angel&quot; being capitalized.<br /> <br /> p.84: &quot;The Angel must spend twice the normal Essence cost of the Incept effect being <b>delivere</b>, and be able to see the target.&quot; Should be <b>delivered</b>.<br /> <br /> p.107: Unless Keneo's lack of unusual appearance is meant to signify a lack of need for Cover, his list of Numina should probably include <b>Mortal Mask</b>; his Rank allows for it.<br /> <br /> p.120: &quot;Once integrated, the <b>victim\u2019s</b> become obsessed[\u2026]&quot; Unnecessary apostrophe.<br /> <br /> p122-3: &quot;The character may subtract her dots in Occult from her required number of successes, <b>reducing</b> the time for each roll by 15 minutes, or [\u2026]&quot; Sould be <b>reduce</b>.<br /> <br /> p.124: &quot;Inhuman Speed&quot; does not exist; possibly substitute &quot;Inhuman Reflexes&quot; or &quot;Long Limbs.&quot;<br /> <br /> p.132: &quot;The shaman can coax the animistic <b>sprits</b> that inhabit the world.&quot; Should be <b>spirits</b>.<br /> <br /> p.153: &quot;The further towards the city center, the less <b>careful God-Machine</b> is with hiding Its nature.&quot; Missing <b>the</b>.<br /> <br /> p.171-3: The Power and Finesse Attributes are out of order on all four angels' character sheets; Power should precede Finesse.<br /> <br /> p.172: &quot;It restrains the Maw and <b>centers its focus, or the lack thereof</b>.&quot; Awkward phrasing; suggest deleting <b>the</b> and possibly replacing the comma with a dash.<br /> <br /> p.177: &quot;Storefronts contain a series of menu selections; a person simply <b>has a push a button</b> and whatever she wanted is delivered through a small tube to her location.&quot; Should be &quot;<b>has to push a button</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> p.177: &quot;Each district contains <b>one (or two, in the case of the central district) angel</b> functioning as a governmental unit.&quot; Parenthetical placement renders the singular &quot;angel&quot; awkward; suggest moving it between &quot;angel&quot; and &quot;functioning.&quot;<br /> <br /> p.177: &quot;The overseer angel is <b>the only angel operatives have any access to their cell leaders.</b>&quot; Odd sentence; suitable correction unclear.<br /> <br /> p.181: &quot;If the first state is not restored within 24 hours, processes <b>being</b> to die permanently, starting with the city\u2019s human population.&quot; Should be <b>begin</b>.<br /> <br /> p.183: It may be preferable to sort the Attributes available to the Wired Merit in an order other than alphabetical.<br /> <br /> p.184: &quot;Stigmatics do not get nearly as much <b>high -evel</b> maintenance, but do undergo after-action reports, performance reviews, and sometimes must contend with early retirement if it seems they are on track to defection.&quot; Should be <b>high-level</b>.<br /> <br /> p.185: &quot;If they do, she leads them<b> to underground connection</b> of rogue stigmatics.&quot; Odd sentence; phrase should probably be &quot;<b>to an underground collection</b> of rogue stigmatics.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 01-11-2016, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T05:40:30-08:00","id":803000,"title":"","content":"p. 43 has a linked-reference to Arcane Physicists on page 71. This should reference page 27.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T08:07:33-08:00","id":803096,"title":"","content":"p58 . Its residents were moving ou;<br /> should be &quot;moving out&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-